{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 的 S01、S05 在短时段里仍堆了不少未标“到时出现”的感受词；S13 又把“谁也没法答应永远”的核心矛盾改得含混，削弱了人物动机。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的加亮短语让要点更容易一眼抓住，纵向顺读也形成了比较自然的阅读路径；感受字缩小并按乐句出现，能把声音、身体反应和心理变化对应起来，细腻程度明显更好。Y 的完整句子在解释人物动机上更稳，尤其 S13 保留了“渴望永恒却知道没人能保证永远”的关键矛盾；但整体观看时，X 的视觉层次、重点提示和音乐同步带来的收益更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dd5a31b7-3923-4a5b-bfcd-92ae05a7c700", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T210240063107Z", "elapsed_seconds": 160.844, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:05:20.916353+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7ce5efa049ac166dc90f9a14ebbb43ccf135a5904640309e2a522a026aa97149", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_at